\c 10
\p 
\v 1 \w Woe| strong="H1945" \w* [unto them that decree]{strong=“H2710” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w unrighteous| strong="H205" \w* \w decrees| strong="H2711" \w*, [and that write]{strong=“H3789” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} \w grievousness| strong="H5999" \w* which [they have prescribed]{strong=“H3789” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”};\f + \fr 10:1 \ft that write…: or, to the writers that write grievousness \f* 
