\v 15 \w Shall the axe| strong="H1631" \w* [boast]{strong=“H6286” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8691”} [itself against him that heweth]{strong=“H2672” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} therewith? or \w shall the saw| strong="H4883" \w* [magnify]{strong=“H1431” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8691”} [itself against him that shaketh]{strong=“H5130” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} [it? as if the rod]{strong=“H7626”} [should shake]{strong=“H5130” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} itself [against them that lift it up]{strong=“H7311” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”}, or \w as if the staff| strong="H4294" \w* [should lift up]{strong=“H7311” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} itself, as if it were \w no wood| strong="H6086" \w*.\f + \fr 10:15 \ft the rod…: or, a rod should shake them that lift it up \f* \f + \fr 10:15 \ft itself, as if…: or, that which is not wood \f* 
