\v 22 \w For though thy people| strong="H5971" \w* \w Israel| strong="H3478" \w* \w be as the sand| strong="H2344" \w* \w of the sea| strong="H3220" \w*, yet \w a remnant| strong="H7605" \w* [of them shall return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}: \w the consumption| strong="H3631" \w* [decreed]{strong=“H2782” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} [shall overflow]{strong=“H7857” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w with righteousness| strong="H6666" \w*.\f + \fr 10:22 \ft of them: Heb. in, or, among, etc \f* \f + \fr 10:22 \ft with: or, in \f* 
