\v 10 \w O my threshing| strong="H4098" \w*, \w and the corn| strong="H1121" \w* \w of my floor| strong="H1637" \w*: [that which I have heard]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} of the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*, \w the God| strong="H430" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*, [have I declared]{strong=“H5046” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} unto you.\f + \fr 21:10 \ft corn: Heb. son \f* 
\p
\v 11 \w The burden| strong="H4853" \w* \w of Dumah| strong="H1746" \w*. [He calleth]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w to me out of Seir| strong="H8165" \w*, [Watchman]{strong=“H8104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, \w what of the night| strong="H3915" \w*? [Watchman]{strong=“H8104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, \w what of the night| strong="H3915" \w*? 
