\v 3 I the \sc Lord\sc* [do keep]{strong=“H5341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [it; I will water]{strong=“H8248” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w it every moment| strong="H7281" \w*: lest any [hurt]{strong=“H6485” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [it, I will keep]{strong=“H5341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w it night| strong="H3915" \w* \w and day| strong="H3117" \w*. 
\v 4 \w Fury| strong="H2534" \w* is [not in me: who would set]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the briers| strong="H8068" \w* and \w thorns| strong="H7898" \w* \w against me in battle| strong="H4421" \w*? [I would go]{strong=“H6585” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [through them, I would burn]{strong=“H6702” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w them together| strong="H3162" \w*.\f + \fr 27:4 \ft go…: or, march against \f* 
\v 5 [Or let him take hold]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w of my strength| strong="H4581" \w*, that [he may make]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w peace| strong="H7965" \w* with me; and [he shall make]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w peace| strong="H7965" \w* with me. 
\v 6 [He shall cause them that come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w of Jacob| strong="H3290" \w* [to take root]{strong=“H8327” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}: \w Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [shall blossom]{strong=“H6692” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [and bud]{strong=“H6524” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [and fill]{strong=“H4390” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the face| strong="H6440" \w* \w of the world| strong="H8398" \w* \w with fruit| strong="H8570" \w*. 
\p
\v 7 [Hath he smitten]{strong=“H5221” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [him, as he smote]{strong=“H4347”} [those that smote]{strong=“H5221” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} him? or [is he slain]{strong=“H2026” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8795”} \w according to the slaughter| strong="H2027" \w* [of them that are slain]{strong=“H2026” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} by him?\f + \fr 27:7 \ft as…: Heb. according to the stroke of \f* 
\v 8 \w In measure| strong="H5432" \w*, [when it shooteth forth]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”}, [thou wilt debate]{strong=“H7378” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [with it: he stayeth]{strong=“H1898” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w his rough| strong="H7186" \w* \w wind| strong="H7307" \w* \w in the day| strong="H3117" \w* \w of the east wind| strong="H6921" \w*.\f + \fr 27:8 \ft it shooteth…: or, thou sendest it forth \f* \f + \fr 27:8 \ft he…: or, when he removeth it with \f* 
\v 9 \w By this| strong="H2063" \w* \w therefore shall the iniquity| strong="H5771" \w* \w of Jacob| strong="H3290" \w* [be purged]{strong=“H3722” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8792”}; and this is \w all the fruit| strong="H6529" \w* [to take away]{strong=“H5493” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} \w his sin| strong="H2403" \w*; [when he maketh]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w all the stones| strong="H68" \w* \w of the altar| strong="H4196" \w* \w as chalkstones| strong="H1615" \w* [that are beaten in sunder]{strong=“H5310” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8794”}, \w the groves| strong="H842" \w* \w and images| strong="H2553" \w* [shall not stand up]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}.\f + \fr 27:9 \ft images: or, sun images \f* 
\v 10 [Yet the defenced]{strong=“H1219” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w city| strong="H5892" \w* shall be \w desolate| strong="H910" \w*, and \w the habitation| strong="H5116" \w* [forsaken]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8794”}, [and left]{strong=“H5800” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} \w like a wilderness| strong="H4057" \w*: \w there shall the calf| strong="H5695" \w* [feed]{strong=“H7462” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and there shall he lie down]{strong=“H7257” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and consume]{strong=“H3615” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w the branches| strong="H5585" \w* thereof. 
\v 11 \w When the boughs| strong="H7105" \w* [thereof are withered]{strong=“H3001” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [they shall be broken off]{strong=“H7665” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}: \w the women| strong="H802" \w* [come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, and [set them on fire]{strong=“H215” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”}: for it is \w a people| strong="H5971" \w* \w of no understanding| strong="H998" \w*: [therefore he that made]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [them will not have mercy]{strong=“H7355” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} [on them, and he that formed]{strong=“H3335” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [them will shew them no favour]{strong=“H2603” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 
\p
\v 12 \w And it shall come to pass in that day| strong="H3117" \w*, that the \sc Lord\sc* [shall beat off]{strong=“H2251” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w from the channel| strong="H7641" \w* \w of the river| strong="H5104" \w* \w unto the stream| strong="H5158" \w* \w of Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*, [and ye shall be gathered]{strong=“H3950” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8792”} \w one| strong="H259" \w* \w by one| strong="H259" \w*, \w O ye children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*. 
\v 13 \w And it shall come to pass in that day| strong="H3117" \w*, that \w the great| strong="H1419" \w* \w trumpet| strong="H7782" \w* [shall be blown]{strong=“H8628” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}, [and they shall come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [which were ready to perish]{strong=“H6” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w in the land| strong="H776" \w* \w of Assyria| strong="H804" \w*, [and the outcasts]{strong=“H5080” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} \w in the land| strong="H776" \w* \w of Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*, [and shall worship]{strong=“H7812” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8694”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w in the holy| strong="H6944" \w* \w mount| strong="H2022" \w* \w at Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w*. 
\c 28
\p 
\v 1 \w Woe| strong="H1945" \w* \w to the crown| strong="H5850" \w* \w of pride| strong="H1348" \w*, \w to the drunkards| strong="H7910" \w* \w of Ephraim| strong="H669" \w*, \w whose glorious| strong="H6643" \w* \w beauty| strong="H8597" \w* is [a fading]{strong=“H5034” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w flower| strong="H6731" \w*, which are \w on the head| strong="H7218" \w* \w of the fat| strong="H8081" \w* \w valleys| strong="H1516" \w* [of them that are overcome]{strong=“H1986” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w with wine| strong="H3196" \w*!\f + \fr 28:1 \ft overcome: Heb. broken \f* 
\v 2 [Behold, the Lord]{strong=“H136”} \w hath a mighty| strong="H2389" \w* \w and strong one| strong="H533" \w*, which \w as a tempest| strong="H2230" \w* \w of hail| strong="H1259" \w* and \w a destroying| strong="H6986" \w* \w storm| strong="H8178" \w*, \w as a flood| strong="H2230" \w* \w of mighty| strong="H3524" \w* \w waters| strong="H4325" \w* [overflowing]{strong=“H7857” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [shall cast down]{strong=“H3240” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w to the earth| strong="H776" \w* \w with the hand| strong="H3027" \w*. 
\v 3 \w The crown| strong="H5850" \w* \w of pride| strong="H1348" \w*, \w the drunkards| strong="H7910" \w* \w of Ephraim| strong="H669" \w*, [shall be trodden]{strong=“H7429” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w under feet| strong="H7272" \w*:\f + \fr 28:3 \ft under…: Heb. with feet \f* 
\v 4 \w And the glorious| strong="H6643" \w* \w beauty| strong="H8597" \w*, which is \w on the head| strong="H7218" \w* \w of the fat| strong="H8081" \w* \w valley| strong="H1516" \w*, [shall be a fading]{strong=“H5034” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w flower| strong="H6733" \w*, and \w as the hasty fruit| strong="H1061" \w* \w before the summer| strong="H7019" \w*; which when [he that looketh]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [upon it seeth]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w while it is yet in his hand| strong="H3709" \w* [he eateth it up]{strong=“H1104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}.\f + \fr 28:4 \ft eateth: Heb. swalloweth \f* 
\p
\v 5 \w In that day| strong="H3117" \w* shall the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w* \w be for a crown| strong="H5850" \w* \w of glory| strong="H6643" \w*, \w and for a diadem| strong="H6843" \w* \w of beauty| strong="H8597" \w*, \w unto the residue| strong="H7605" \w* \w of his people| strong="H5971" \w*, 
\v 6 \w And for a spirit| strong="H7307" \w* \w of judgment| strong="H4941" \w* [to him that sitteth]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w in judgment| strong="H4941" \w*, \w and for strength| strong="H1369" \w* [to them that turn]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w the battle| strong="H4421" \w* \w to the gate| strong="H8179" \w*. 
\p
\v 7 \w But they| strong="H428" \w* [also have erred]{strong=“H7686” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w through wine| strong="H3196" \w*, \w and through strong drink| strong="H7941" \w* [are out of the way]{strong=“H8582” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}; \w the priest| strong="H3548" \w* \w and the prophet| strong="H5030" \w* [have erred]{strong=“H7686” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w through strong drink| strong="H7941" \w*, [they are swallowed up]{strong=“H1104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w of| strong="H4480" \w* \w wine| strong="H3196" \w*, [they are out of the way]{strong=“H8582” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w through strong drink| strong="H7941" \w*; [they err]{strong=“H7686” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w in vision| strong="H7203" \w*, [they stumble]{strong=“H6328” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} in \w judgment| strong="H6417" \w*. 
