\v 11 [Behold, thou hast heard]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w what the kings| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Assyria| strong="H804" \w* [have done]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w to all lands| strong="H776" \w* [by destroying them utterly]{strong=“H2763” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”}; [and shalt thou be delivered]{strong=“H5337” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}? 
