\v 13 Where is \w the king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Hamath| strong="H2574" \w*, \w and the king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Arphad| strong="H774" \w*, \w and the king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of the city| strong="H5892" \w* \w of Sepharvaim| strong="H5617" \w*, \w Hena| strong="H2012" \w*, \w and Ivah| strong="H5755" \w*? 
\p
\v 14 \w And Hezekiah| strong="H2396" \w* [received]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the letter| strong="H5612" \w* \w from the hand| strong="H3027" \w* \w of the messengers| strong="H4397" \w*, [and read]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [it: and Hezekiah]{strong=“H2396”} [went up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto the house| strong="H1004" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*, [and spread]{strong=“H6566” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w it before| strong="H6440" \w* the \sc Lord\sc*. 
